      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so you're saying the suit and his ability to give a specific time makes him more trustworthy? i guess i'm wondering if the hoodie or his age makes him look \"suspicious\" or like he's less of a \"stable\" witness to a jury. do you think a jury would take his testimony less seriously just because of how he looks or his background?",
